gital Marketing, Cloud Computing, Project Management, Data Science, IT, Software Development, and many other emerging technologies.","author_bio":null,"author_designation":null,"author_image":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002Fauthor_simplilearn.jpg","author_linkedin":null,"author_twitter":null}],"seo_url":"day-in-the-life-of-a-scrum-master-webinar","small_description":"A Day in the Life of Scrum Masters: Live Demo of Scrum Ceremonies","type":"webinar","is_demo":null,"image_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Fice9%2Fwebinar_thum_image%2FAug_25_2026.jpg","duration":"01:00","ebook_url":null,"url_join":null,"thumbnail_image_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Fice9%2Ffree_resources_article_thumb%2FSL_thumbnail.png","date":"25-08-2026","time":"14:30","timezone":"Asia\u002FKolkata","source_timezone":"UTC","created_at":"2026-08-07T11:50:11+05:30","updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:05:40+05:30","display_type":"Webinar","webinar_at_target_timezone":"Tue, Aug 25, 2026","local_time_zone_code":"IST","local_time":"8:00 PM"},{"id":"57a1c2fdd2161c6e128b4792","title":"Top 28 Free Agile Tools for Project Managers","authors":[{"author_name":"Aman Luthra","about_author":"A certified PMP and PMI-ACP, Aman plays the role of an Agile delivery manager at Simplilearn. He is an experienced professional with over 9 years of experience in eLearning and Instructional Design projects.","author_image":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002FAman_Luthra.jpg","author_linkedin":"https:\u002F\u002Fin.linkedin.com\u002Fin\u002Faman-luthra-b8a56510","author_twitter":null}],"seo_url":"free-agile-tools-for-every-project-manager-article","small_description":"As a Project Manager, it is important to know the best tools to work with. This article lists the best Agile tools.","type":"article","image_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Fice9%2Ffree_resources_article_thumb%2F5-Free-Agile-Tools-For-Any-Project-Manager.jpg","duration":null,"url_join":null,"thumbnail_image_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Fice9%2Ffree_resources_article_thumb%2F5-Free-Agile-Tools-For-Any-Project-Manager-Th.jpg","date":null,"time":null,"timezone":null,"engagement_score":143967,"display_type":"Article"}],"details":[{"_id":"5ec6611c70161c44198b4aae","type":"tutorial_homepage","status":4,"title":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners","display_name":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners","authors":[{"author_name":"Simplilearn","about_author":"Simplilearn is one of the world’s leading providers of online training for Digital Marketing, Cloud Computing, Project Management, Data Science, IT, Software Development, and many other emerging technologies.","author_image":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002Fauthor_simplilearn.jpg","author_linkedin":"https:\u002F\u002Fin.linkedin.com\u002Fcompany\u002Fsimplilearn","author_twitter":"","author_seo_url":"simplilearn"}],"small_description":"The Agile Tutorial will help you to understand the agile methodology, its structure and the complete agile process.","verticals":[],"long_description":"\u003Cp\u003EAgile project management is a methodology designed to work in an iterative structure, adapting to changes, responding to constant feedback in an effort to provide constant results. When related to software, this methodology defines roles, increases collaboration, ongoing review and adaptation, self-organization, and cross-functionality of the teams. It is a software engineering best-practice for rapid delivery of high-quality software, tailored to customer needs and aligned with the business goals. In this Agile tutorial, you will learn the complete agile process from SDLC to various subsets of agile methodology, the difference between agile and scrum, and also get prepared for agile-related interviews. So start learning the agile tutorial now and become an Agile expert to maximize productivity and start stimulating error-free results.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","is_simplearn_content":true,"created_at":"2020-05-21T16:38:12+05:30","image_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Fice9%2Fwebinar_thum_image%2FAgile_Tutorial.jpg","seo_url":"tutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial","meta_title":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A [Step-by-Step] Guide for Beginners","meta_description":"This Agile Scrum Tutorial✔️helps you to learn the agile & scrum methodology, its structure, & user stories. Read on to learn✔️the Agile and Scrum process","meta_keywords":"agile tutorial, scrum tutorial, agile scrum tutorial, agile and scrum tutorial, agile tutorial for beginners, scrum tutorial for beginners, agile methodology tutorial, scrum methodology tutorial, scrum master tutorial, agile methodology tutorial for beginners","h1_tag":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners","thumbnail_image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002Fauthor_simplilearn.jpg","alt_text":"Agile Scrum Tutorial","canonical":"tutorials%2Fagile-scrum-tutorial","indexed":null,"show_class_table":true,"is_class_room_schema":true,"meta_tags":[],"facebook_description":"This Agile Scrum Tutorial✔️helps you to learn the agile & scrum methodology, its structure, & user stories. Read on to learn✔️the Agile and Scrum process","facebook_image":null,"facebook_title":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners","facebook_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Ftutorials%2Fagile-scrum-tutorial","facebook_sitename":"Simplilearn.com","twitter_description":"This Agile Scrum Tutorial✔️helps you to learn the agile & scrum methodology, its structure, & user stories. Read on to learn✔️the Agile and Scrum process","twitter_image":null,"twitter_title":"Agile Scrum Tutorial: A Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners","twitter_url":"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.simplilearn.com%2Ftutorials%2Fagile-scrum-tutorial","twitter_sitename":"@simplilearn","categories":[],"tag_skills":["agile tutorial","scrum tutorial","agile scrum tutorial","agile and scrum tutorial","agile tutorial for beginners","scrum tutorial for beginners","agile methodology tutorial","scrum methodology tutorial","scrum master tutorial","agile methodology tutorial for beginners"],"tag_departments":[],"tag_designations":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","learningHours":2,"highlights":"\u003Cp\u003E➤ Agile project management is a methodology designed to work in an iterative structure, adapting to changes, responding to constant feedback in an effort to provide constant results.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E➤When related to software, this methodology defines roles, increases collaboration, ongoing review and adaptation, self-organization, and cross-functionality of the teams. It is a software engineering best-practice for rapid delivery of high-quality software, tailored to customer needs and aligned with the business goals.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E➤In this Agile tutorial, you will learn the complete agile process from SDLC to various subsets of agile methodology, the difference between agile and scrum, and also get prepared for agile-related interviews.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESo start learning the agile tutorial now and become an Agile expert to maximize productivity and start stimulating error-free results.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbanner id=\"6387e3dc01c54768098b45b1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fbanner\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","topics_covered":"\u003Cp\u003EThe topics covered in the Agile Scrum tutorial is:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fwhat-is-agile?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"What is Agile?\"\u003EWhat is Agile?\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fwhat-is-scrum?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"What is Scrum?\"\u003EWhat is Scrum?\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fagile-process?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Agile Process\"\u003EAgile Process\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fagile-vs-waterfall?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Agile vs Waterfall\"\u003EAgile vs Waterfall\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fagile-vs-scrum?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Agile vs Scrum\"\u003EAgile vs Scrum\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fscrum-vs-kanban?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum vs. Kanban\"\u003EScrum vs. Kanban\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fhow-to-become-a-scrum-master?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"How to Become a Scrum Master?\"\u003EHow to Become a Scrum Master?\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fscrum-master-interview-questions?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum Master Interview Question &amp; Answers\"\u003EScrum Master Interview Question &amp; Answers\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Ch2 id=\"lesson_1_what_is_agile_and_its_benefits\"\u003ELesson 1: What is Agile and its Benefits?\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fwhat-is-agile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Agile\"\u003EAgile\u003C\u002Fa\u003E is a process that lets teams manage a project by breaking it up into several stages. It involves constant collaboration with stakeholders with constant improvement and iteration at each and every stage.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbanner id=\"63f311a9e3ab4663748b456e\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fbanner\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn this methodology, clients need to describe, to their project team, how the end product will be used, and what are the various problems that it will solve. After the work commences, project teams cycle through a process of planning, executing, and evaluating. This might change the final deliverable that fits customers’ requirements in a better manner. Continuous collaboration is required among team members and project stakeholders as this helps to make fully informed decisions. This Agile Scrum tutorial will also help you understand various benefits and the types of methodologies.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDifferent types of Agile methodologies:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ch4\u003EKanban\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\nKanban helps project teams to execute timely production by enabling everyone to have a visibility of where the work is in the project and what is lined up next. Kanban projects are mostly managed through a Kanban Board.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ch4\u003EScrum\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\nThis uses a Scrum Board, quite similar to a Kanban Board. It groups tasks into columns based on progress. \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fwhat-is-scrum?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum\"\u003EScrum\u003C\u002Fa\u003E usually breaks down a project into sprints, planning, and managing, one sprint at a time. Scrum also has unique project roles, which include a scrum master and Product Owner. \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ch4\u003EExtreme programming (XP)\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\nDesigned for Agile software development projects, XP focuses on continuous software development and customer delivery. It uses intervals or sprints that are quite similar to a scrum methodology.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ch4\u003EFeature-driven Development (FDD)\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\nIt is also one of the software-specific Agile frameworks. In this methodology, software models are created every two weeks. This requires a development and design plan for every software model feature. This implies that it has more rigorous documentation requirements as compared to XP, so it fulfills all the requirements for teams related to advanced design and planning abilities.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbanner id=\"63f311a9e3ab4663748b456e\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fbanner\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lesson_2_what_is_scrum\"\u003ELesson 2: What is Scrum?\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fwhat-is-scrum?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum\"\u003EScrum\u003C\u002Fa\u003E framework is used for managing product development and other knowledge-related work. It is structured in such a way that it allows project teams to incorporate best practices from other frameworks. In this lesson of the Agile Scrum tutorial, you’ll learn the A-Z of Scrum.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lesson_3_understanding_agile_process\"\u003ELesson 3: Understanding Agile Process\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fagile-process?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Agile\"\u003EAgile\u003C\u002Fa\u003E is used for improving the project management and software development process. It helps project teams to deliver value to customers. The work provided, although small, is incremental in nature. As a result, teams are able to respond to changes quite efficiently. In this Agile Scrum tutorial, you will learn all about this process, its uses, ways to implement it.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lesson_4_scrum_vs_kanban\"\u003ELesson 4: Scrum vs. Kanban\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKanban includes visualizing all the work, limiting work in progress, and maximizing output. In Kanban, the project teams focus on reducing the project cycle from start to finish, usually by using a kanban board and continuously improving the workflow. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn the other hand, Scrum teams are committed to shipping working software through sprints. The goal is to build learning loops to collect and integrate customer feedback. Scrum project teams adopt specific roles and hold regular ceremonies to keep things moving forward. Start learning this lesson from the Agile Scrum tutorial to know the pros and cons of both \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fscrum-vs-kanban?source=sl_frs_nav_playlist_video_clicked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum and Kanban\"\u003EScrum and Kanban\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, and choose the right one for your team!\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lesson_5_becoming_a_certified_scrum_master_csm\"\u003ELesson 5: Becoming a Certified Scrum Master (CSM)\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Ftutorials\u002Fagile-scrum-tutorial\u002Fhow-to-become-a-scrum-master\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Scrum Master\"\u003EScrum Master\u003C\u002Fa\u003E is a team leader responsible for handling the project, guiding the team and the product owner, and making sure that team members follow agile values and best practices.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA scrum master facilitates communication and collaboration between the business, the product owner, the team, and other individuals who are involved in the project. He or she works in the background and is not included in the product strategy part. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELearn all about a certified scrum master and how to become one in this agile scrum tutorial, along with various scrum practices.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbanner id=\"63f311a9e3ab4663748b456e\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fbanner\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EStart Learning the Agile Scrum Tutorial Now!\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgile project management involves taking a consistent approach to delivering a project through its life cycle. These iterative life cycles consist of several iterations or continual steps that are being taken for the project completion. Start learning the Agile Scrum tutorial now to master project management.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E If interested in taking up an agile scrum master course, \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fasm-certification-training-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"click here!\"\u003Eclick here!\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","skills":[{"skill":"Agile and Scrum Terminologies"},{"skill":"Scrum Methodology"},{"skill":"Lean Software Development"},{"skill":"Kanban Software Development"},{"skill":"Dynamic Systems Development Method (DSDM)"},{"skill":"Feature Driven Development (FDD)"},{"skill":"Extreme Programming (XP)"}],"toolsTitle":null,"tools":[],"segments":[1],"linked_author_id":"5940c4a100c547581b8b4632","is_promotion":false,"products":[{"id":4,"type":"course","name":"Certified ScrumMaster® (CSM)"},{"id":766,"type":"course","name":"Leading SAFe ® 6 training with SAFe Agilist Certification"}],"primary_product_id":4,"primary_product_type":"course","updated_at":"2026-08-09T14:01:42+05:30","related_resources":{"ebook":[{"title":"CSM Study Guide: Master Scrum in 48 Hours","last_updated_on":"2025-05-27T15:58:31+05:30","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"ebook","page_url":"\u002Fcsm-study-guide-to-master-scrum-pdf","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Febooks\u002FCover_CSM_Study_Guide.png","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","no_of_views":"0","id":"ebook-68358d6670121ca4528b4576"},{"title":"Report: Skill Acquisition For The Digital Age","last_updated_on":"2019-02-04T12:43:26+05:30","category":"Career Fast-track","item_type":"ebook","page_url":"\u002Fskill-acquisition-for-digital-age-guide-pdf","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002FSkill-Aquisition.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","no_of_views":"0","id":"ebook-5982db0fab121c4c1b8b45b2"},{"title":"The State of Upskilling in 2023","last_updated_on":"2023-07-19T17:23:36+05:30","category":"Career Fast-track","item_type":"ebook","page_url":"\u002Fsimplilearn-state-of-learners-report-pdf","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Febooks\u002FBANNER_2_2022.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","no_of_views":"0","id":"ebook-630df9bf5fab4676148b45a2"},{"title":"The Changing Landscape of Tuition Benefits Program","last_updated_on":"2025-06-19T17:33:59+05:30","item_type":"ebook","page_url":"\u002Fchanging-landscape-of-tuition-benefits-program-pdf","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Febooks\u002FBanner_SLH_GenAI.png","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","no_of_views":"0","id":"ebook-670cb403ae474001338b4637"}],"webinar":[{"title":"A Day in the Life of Scrum Masters: A Demo of Scrum Ceremonies","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fday-in-the-life-of-a-scrum-master-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002FAug_25_2026.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["25-08-2026 8:00 PM","01:00","Asia\u002FKolkata","na","IST"],"id":"webinar-6a75791bb0161ca0748b4575"},{"title":"Certified vs. Professional Scrum Master: Which Scrum Certification Fits You Best in 2024","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fcertified-vs-professional-scrum-master-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002F13_aug_scrum.png","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["13-08-2024 9:00 PM","01:00","Asia\u002FKolkata","is_webcast","IST"],"id":"webinar-669ec3e2ca161c24248b45a6"},{"title":"A Day in the Life of Scrum Masters: Live Demo of Scrum Ceremonies","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fday-in-life-of-scrum-master-live-demo-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002FSep_29.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["29-09-2025 6:00 PM","01:30","America\u002FMexico_City","is_webcast","CDT"],"id":"webinar-68beb9217dab465a418b4574"},{"title":"Why Organizations Need Certified Scrum Masters in 2025","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fwhy-organizations-need-certified-scrum-masters-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002FJune_19.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["19-06-2025 9:00 PM","01:30","Asia\u002FColombo","is_webcast","+0530"],"id":"webinar-683d8c8470121c3c5f8b45aa"},{"title":"Agile Coach's PoV: Trends Shaping Agile Careers in 2025","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fagile-coach-trends-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002FMay_6.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["06-05-2025 9:00 PM","01:00","Asia\u002FKolkata","is_webcast","IST"],"id":"webinar-67fe0aabae4740da2a8b4574"},{"title":"How to Ace the Certified Scrum Master Exam on Your 1st Attempt in 2024","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Fhow-to-ace-the-certified-scrum-master-exam-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002F25_July_scrum.png","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["25-07-2024 9:00 PM","01:00","Asia\u002FKolkata","is_webcast","IST"],"id":"webinar-667e9cccca161c20478b4595"},{"title":"Stay Ahead of the Curve: Unlock Tomorrow’s Agile Potential","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"webinar","page_url":"\u002Ftomorrows-agile-potential-guide-webinar","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Fwebinar_thum_image\u002F30_jan_CSM.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Simplilearn","no_of_views":"0","additional_details":["30-01-2025 9:30 PM","01:00","Asia\u002FKolkata","is_webcast","IST"],"id":"webinar-6762a7c8ae47409c468b463f"}],"article":[{"title":"Agile vs Scrum: Know the Main Differences and Similarities","last_updated_on":"2026-06-22T00:40:58+05:30","category":"Agile and Scrum","item_type":"article","page_url":"\u002Fagile-vs-scrum-article","image_url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.simplilearn.com\u002Fice9\u002Ffree_resources_article_thumb\u002FAgile_vs_Scrum.jpg","star_ratings":"0.0","no_of_learners":"0","author":"Vanshika Agrawal","no_of_views":"119464","id":"article-5d8cf7f70e43406a4c8b4607"},{"title":"Everything You Need t